<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor to borrow $300 mln via paper, bills.</title>
<headline>Cimpor to borrow $300 mln via paper, bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese cement group Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal plans to borrow up to $300 million, via commercial paper and medium- and long-term bonds, to help pay for recent acquisitions in Brazil, its president Antonio Sousa Gomes said.</p>
</text>
